##* READING-TIME METHODOLOGY

Reading time is an estimate, not an exact measurement.

Use a documented default reading speed of approximately
200 words per minute unless a different site-wide standard is
established later.

Calculate:

estimatedMinutes = wordCount / 200

Round appropriately for display.

Examples:
- 0–199 words → "Less than 1 min"
- 200–399 words → "1 min"
- 400–599 words → "2 min"

Label the metric as:
"Estimated reading time"
